<title>USA: American General names Ellen Masterson CFO.</title>
<headline>American General names Ellen Masterson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>American General Corp said Wednesday it named Ellen Masterson senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said said Masterson replaces Carl Santillo. The company was not immediately able to provide further details.</p>
<p>Masterson was formerly a partner at Coopers &amp; Lybrand LLP.</p>
